  "instructions": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "Combine juices, coconut cream, and both rums in a cocktail shaker and fill with crushed ice. Shake well until chilled, about 10 seconds; pour (unstrained) into tall glass or tiki mug. Dust top of drink with cinnamon and nutmeg; garnish with orange wheel, pineapple spear and cinnamon stick.",
